   "created": "2024-11-22T16:43:58.10809Z",
   "modified": "2024-11-22T16:43:58.10809Z",
   "name": "Develop AI-Generated Images (Deepfakes)",
   "description": "Deepfakes refer to AI-generated falsified photos, videos, or soundbites. An influence operation may use deepfakes to depict an inauthentic situation by synthetically recreating an individual’s face, body, voice, and physical gestures.<br><br> <b>Associated Techniques and Sub-techniques:</b><br> <b>T0145.002: AI-Generated Account Imagery:</b> Analysts should use this sub-technique to document use of AI generated imagery in accounts’ profile pictures or other account imagery.",
   "kill_chain_phases": [
