  {
   "type": "attack-pattern",
   "spec_version": "2.1",
   "id": "attack-pattern--75d11cd8-2f92-4d73-97c5-27356c8a2758",
   "created_by_ref": "identity--f1a0f560-2d9e-4c5d-bf47-7e96e805de82",
   "created": "2024-11-22T16:43:58.220194Z",
   "modified": "2024-11-22T16:43:58.220194Z",
   "name": "Fabricated Persona",
   "description": "An individual or institution pretending to have a persona without any legitimate claim to that persona is presenting a fabricated persona, such as a person who presents themselves as a member of a country’s military without having worked in any capacity with the military (T0143.002: Fabricated Persona, T0097.105: Military Personnel).<br><br> Sometimes real people can present entirely fabricated personas; they can use real names and photos on social media while also pretending to have credentials or traits they don’t have in real life.",
